<title>NETHERLANDS: Montell Q1 results up.</title>
<headline>Montell Q1 results up.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Operating result		    69    vs  42</p>
<p>    Net sales revenues		 962    vs 903</p>
<p>    Cost of sales			800    vs 757</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 162    vs 146</p>
<p>    Operating expenses		  93    vs 104</p>
<p>NOTE - Montell Polyolefins is a plastics joint venture between Royal Dutch/Shell and Italy's Montedison . It said the rise in operating results was caused by higher polypropylene margins and cost efficiency programs.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
